{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate","id":1391275,"title":"why the infernal fluff hate","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-24T15:08:26-07:00","id":1391275,"title":"why the infernal fluff hate","content":"there is something I cant understand about 2ed infernals. its honestly the matt ward of this fandom, in that it gets a lot of hate for reasons I cant comprehend. people say it has gang rape, but I cant see it. and why would people not like the yozi's trying to be free. they seek freedom, and just think of the epic storys that could be wrought in the new primordial war.<br /> <br /> yes lilun is horrible wrong, but it was created by the ebon dragon. the creators say that an all loving character with compassion 5 would kick him in the groin just on the principle of things. And there the chosen of hell, of course there gonna be body horror.<br /> <br /> I am not trying to get any flame from this (don't call me bad words or anything like that). but I do seek knowledge. so please enlighten me.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Edit:<br /> <br /> Mod here. The conversation here is terrible. It's calling out fans for being upset about things [edition wars], arguing about being overly sensitive about rape, and generally quite a lot of other things that break forum rules. So, I'm going to be shutting this thread down completely. Because in simple terms, &quot;Why the infernal hate?&quot; can be answered with, &quot;Some fans didn't like it and that's their right.&quot; In this case it's also, &quot;Some developers didn't like it.&quot;<br /> <br /> *consigns thread to the Underworld*</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-24-2020, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:29:21-07:00","id":1391290,"title":"","content":"I love Infernals. It's my favourite splat. The rape and torture and cosmic body horror is why.<br /> <br /> But the material people object to is in Chapters 1 and 2.<br /> <br /> Every single canon Infernal gets raped by their patron and caste Yozi and their 3CDs.<br /> Green Sun Princes have competitions to see how long they can stomach raping Lillun for. She was brought to hell ten years ago as a twelve year old girl and has been non-stop tortured ever since.<br /> The sample Akuma was raped by two Dragon-Blooded, whom she keeps locked in hell getting raped by demons.<br /> <br /> Really, just spend five minutes on the first two chapters and you'll find the rape.<br /> <br /> Many people just think it's too much -- trading storytelling and character building for &quot;lol rape&quot;. And if rape is an emotional trigger for you (and it is for a lot of people) that makes Infernals pretty unplayable.<br /> <br /> Again, I like it. I like the cackling evil of hell -- Acts of Villiany are great! I like the visceral horror, that's the point. But you can easily hand-wave what you don't like if you don't want to go full &quot;Magical Realm&quot;.<br /> <br /> For me, Infernals are like the Sabbat. They are the bad guys. You are supposed to stop them. If you want to play the bad guys then you are playing the bad guys.<br /> <br /> There's also an issue where players feel obligated to run games about the Yozis escaping, which sidelines other stories and makes Exalted really one-track. The game is NOT supposed to be about the Yozis escaping.<br /> <br /> For some people these are serious issues. And the devs (past and present) have resolved to fix this with a full rewrite of Infernals for 3E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 05-24-2020, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:31:32-07:00","id":1391293,"title":"","content":"Because some people are overly sensitive.<br /> <br /> Demons in general and yozis, in particular, are not the best of people, especially the ebon dragon.<br /> <br /> And it turns up they are more than willing to mess people badly (like lilun) to achieve their objectives.<br /> <br /> Seriously, its nothing more than that. If someone don't like X chunk of the book, they can simply ignore it.<br /> <br /> The infernal hate is completely irrational if you ask me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12829-tzimiscelord","name":"Tzimiscelord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:35:12-07:00","id":1391295,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=JohnDoe244;n1391290]Every single canon Infernal gets raped by their patron and caste Yozi and their 3CDs.<br /> Green Sun Princes have competitions to see how long they can stomach raping Lilun for.[QUOTE]<br /> <br /> They are my favourite splat too.<br /> <br /> Correct me if im wrong but..... isnt that actually an assumption?<br /> <br /> It said that the infernal communes with the yozi and 3CDs, but the word rape is never actually used in that context.<br /> <br /> And while its one of the possible ways of interpreting it, its far from the only one.<br /> <br /> Also, i cant recall the infernal exalted raping lilun. It is actually stated or is another thing you can deduce tho tis not directly stated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12829-tzimiscelord","name":"Tzimiscelord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:35:44-07:00","id":1391297,"title":"","content":"again, I don't see it. Lilun is pitted, and again there is a grand party for each infernal. there is a line that, if you squint, can be interepreted as the souls rapping the infernal. and I see the infernals being like the abyssal, fufiling a grand evil goal while obeying the whims of dark masters. and maybe, just maybe, finding redemption. <br /> <br /> where does that lilun raping contest come from? that's new to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:35:53-07:00","id":1391298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate#post1391275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> people say it has gang rape, but I cant see it</div> </div> </div> </div>The whole thing of initiation rituals with the demons and jouten.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">and why would people not like the yozi's trying to be free. they seek freedom, and just think of the epic storys that could be wrought in the new primordial war.</div> </div> </div> </div>It entails some scope creep that writers grew weary of and made compelling arguments about for some fans who didn't already share the sentiment.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">yes lilun is horrible wrong, but it was created by the ebon dragon</div> </div> </div> </div>The Ebon Dragon isn't real. A writer has to come up with the idea of one Yozi being super evil, and then make another decision to portray super evil as being like that. There are multiple stages where somebody can think twice about it, and &quot;we really have to go hard on the edge for the sake of setting consistency&quot; is a weak excuse.<br /> <br /> Youtuber Dan Olson talks about stuff like this in his video on the Thermian Argument.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">And there the chosen of hell, of course there gonna be body horror. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>And there should be, and there is. That doesn't mean anything goes.<br /> <br /> Heck, even the idea that Lillim suffers a horrible fate as the Phylactery Womb could have been handled more tastefully by relying on allusions. <br /> <br /> The Hell portrayed in Games of Divinity that people liked so much was more sophisticated than just a litany of horrors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:38:21-07:00","id":1391302,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Tzimiscelord;n1391295][QUOTE=JohnDoe244;n1391290]Every single canon Infernal gets raped by their patron and caste Yozi and their 3CDs.<br /> Green Sun Princes have competitions to see how long they can stomach raping Lilun for.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> They are my favourite splat too.<br /> <br /> Correct me if im wrong but..... isnt that actually an assumption?<br /> <br /> It said that the infernal communes with the yozi and 3CDs, but the word rape is never actually used in that context.<br /> <br /> And while its one of the possible ways of interpreting it, its far from the only one.<br /> <br /> Also, i cant recall the infernal exalted raping lilun. It is actually stated or is another thing you can deduce tho tis not directly stated? </div> </div> </div>Exaltly. I never see the word rape mentioned once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:39:05-07:00","id":1391303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tzimiscelord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391293#post1391293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because some people are overly sensitive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eeeeeeehhhhhhh....<br /> <br /> If I sold a splat on being the decadent champions of hell reclaiming the world for their ancient masters, unjustly imprisoned for millennia, using the very cosmic powers said masters used to forge reality... then a lot of my female/trans friends would be all over that.<br /> <br /> And then they read the book and see they get gang raped by said masters and they never want to play Exalted again.<br /> <br /> Like, I have phobias that come up a lot in Exalted. I don't use an X-card or anything because I have a level of emotional resilience and sufficient coping strategies to play through, recognising that it's just fantasy. And if I don't want to play something then I just don't. End of.<br /> <br /> But it's not like getting raped is some minor &quot;no big deal, walk it off&quot; thing. It doesn't bother me, but I see why it bothers others and I respect the dev's decision to change it. I think it's a mistake, but I understand why they're doing it.<br /> <br /> And I have high hopes for 3E Infernals. They sound rad.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Lillun rape is a sample ordeal on page 39.<br /> <br /> PC rape is on page 30 &quot;the Exalt\u2019s body is shared around among the other Third Circle souls of his master, followed by the jouten of the architect of the Reclamation who designed his Urge (if that Yozi is different from who claims the Exalt\u2019s caste). Any humanity to which the Exalt might have been clinging is more than likely stripped away during this time.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 05-24-2020, 06:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:41:25-07:00","id":1391304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391298#post1391298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The whole thing of initiation rituals with the demons and jouten.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It entails some scope creep that writers grew weary of and made compelling arguments about for some fans who didn't already share the sentiment.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Ebon Dragon isn't real. A writer has to come up with the idea of one Yozi being super evil, and then make another decision to portray super evil as being like that. There are multiple stages where somebody can think twice about it, and &amp;quot;we really have to go hard on the edge for the sake of setting consistency&amp;quot; is a weak excuse.<br /> <br /> Youtuber Dan Olson talks about stuff like this in his video on the Thermian Argument.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And there should be, and there is. That doesn't mean anything goes.<br /> <br /> Heck, even the idea that Lillim suffers a horrible fate as the Phylactery Womb could have been handled more tastefully by relying on allusions. <br /> <br /> The Hell portrayed in Games of Divinity that people liked so much was more sophisticated than just a litany of horrors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, if you saint you can see the rape in the initiations. But i see that as nit being rape. <br /> <br /> How do you get the ebon dragon not being real? Hes a vital part of the lore. He inspired the unconqured sun. <br /> <br /> Writing this on my phone, so yeah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:43:00-07:00","id":1391306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391303#post1391303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And then they read the book and see they get gang raped by said masters and they never want to play Exalted again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, I recall infernals communing with their masters, but not getting raped.<br /> <br /> Also, rape is a terrible crime, sure, but so is torture and murder, and exalted also have plenty of those.<br /> <br /> I cant understand why reading about people being tortured until they beg for death, then healing and tortured again is ok, but reading about being raped isnt.<br /> <br /> Maybe i have too little empathy, but i think the guy locked in a dozen or so cycles of terrible and excruciating torture have it at the very least as bad.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12829-tzimiscelord","name":"Tzimiscelord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:49:01-07:00","id":1391310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tzimiscelord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391306#post1391306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, rape is a terrible crime, sure, but so is torture and murder, and exalted also have plenty of those.</div> </div> </div> </div>My inference is this will also be dialled back. Like how Raksi's baby eating was dialled back.<br /> <br /> Again, not my preference. But I understand why they'd want to make Exalted more PG-13.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:53:03-07:00","id":1391313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391304#post1391304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Again, if you saint you can see the rape in the initiations. But i see that as nit being rape. <br /> <br /> How do you get the ebon dragon not being real? Hes a vital part of the lore. He inspired the unconqured sun. <br /> <br /> Writing this on my phone, so yeah.</div> </div> </div> </div>He's a fictional character who was massively rewritten from his 1E portrayal.<br /> <br /> A real person chose to massively retcon him. The decisions that real person, the writer, made has caused many real life people to suffer. 2E The Ebon Dragon isn't high art -- it's a massive retcon.<br /> <br /> The current developers want to undo that suffering, presumably by undoing that retcon.<br /> <br /> I get why you might disagree with this, but I don't see how you don't understand this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T15:57:48-07:00","id":1391315,"title":"","content":"Um, what are the differences? The only real difference i can see is the whole marrage metaplot. In both editions hes the emnodiment of lies and shadows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T16:03:36-07:00","id":1391321,"title":"","content":"I never read 2e Infernals and based on this thread I don\u2019t want to.<br /> <br /> That being said, I\u2019m willing to give Infernals a chance in 3e. I just prefer to avoid graphic descriptions of rape and sexual assault, and from what I hear it sounds like 2e Infernals pretty much revels in that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T16:14:48-07:00","id":1391327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391304#post1391304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Again, if you saint you can see the rape in the initiations. But i see that as nit being rape.</div> </div> </div> </div>I find that the book is written in a manner that does invite some reading between the lines.<br /> <br /> And more direct things like the description of Lillun being transported to Malfeas establish some of the tone of how that reading is applied.<br /> <br /> This isn't about technicalities, it's a general tone thing, and the tone of that half of the book is somewhat... grimier than was fitting to the tastes of a late 2000s audience.<br /> <br /> Also, since your opening question is broader than done of the specifics you've focused on, I'll say that the other half of what is to be criticized about that half of the book is that it doesn't really tell us much about the Infernal Exalted as people. There's too much focus on the outlook of the Yozis.<br /> <br /> Whatever you think of the merits of Primordial War take two, a book introducing some new Exalted is not the right place for it. There are issues with making the Infernals seem primarily like the facilitators of that plot.<br /> <br /> Yeah, there were writers who disavowed those chapters and talked about what was meant to be different, but this is an answer of one asks what is looked back on negatively about the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T16:14:51-07:00","id":1391328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391275-why-the-infernal-fluff-hate?p=1391321#post1391321\" rel=\"nofollow